  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-wang-tanzhi-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-wang-tanzhi-family:p001:m0000" ref="a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAA">坦之</persName>子<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-wang-tanzhi-family:p001:m0003" ref="a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAAA">愷</persName>，娶<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-wang-tanzhi-family:p001:m0006" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓温</persName>第二女，字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-wang-tanzhi-family:p001:m0013" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAG">伯子</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-wang-tanzhi-family:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-wang-tanzhi-family:p002:m0000" ref="a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAA">王坦之</persName>娶順陽郡<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-wang-tanzhi-family:p002:m0007" ref="ae7_dcf_084">范汪</persName>女，名<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-wang-tanzhi-family:p002:m0012" ref="ae7_dcf_084_A">蓋</persName>，即<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-wang-tanzhi-family:p002:m0015" ref="ffc_ea1_a8f">甯</persName>妹也，生<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-005-wang-tanzhi-family:p002:m0020" ref="a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAAD">忱</persName>。</p>
</text>
